@page: about
@title: About · S. M. Builders & Developers, since 1967
@desc: S. M. Group began its journey in 1967. Its philosophy rests on experiential design, novelty and commitment, guided by Islamic values. Honesty, integrity, flexibility.
===CSS===
.phero .stage { --word-top: 18%; }
.story { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: clamp(28px, 5vw, 80px); align-items: start; }
.story .big { font-size: clamp(19px, 1.6vw, 23px); line-height: 1.6; color: var(--ink-2); }
.story .big + .big { margin-top: var(--space-lg); }
.story .ph { border-radius: var(--r-xl); aspect-ratio: 4 / 4.4; }
.story-img { padding: 8px; border-radius: var(--r-xl); position: sticky; top: 120px; }
.story-img .ph { border-radius: calc(var(--r-xl) - 8px); }
@media (max-width: 900px) { .story { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } .story-img { position: static; } }
.vis { padding: clamp(32px, 6vw, 90px); text-align: center; }
.vis .h2 { max-width: 20ch; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; z-index: 1; font-size: clamp(30px, 4.2vw, 64px); }
.vis p { position: relative; z-index: 1; margin: 22px auto 0; max-width: 60ch; }
.vals { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
.val { position: relative; padding: clamp(24px, 3vw, 40px); border-radius: var(--r-xl); min-height: 300px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; overflow: hidden; }
.val .n { font: 800 clamp(70px, 9vw, 130px)/.8 var(--font-display); font-stretch: 120%; letter-spacing: -.05em; color: var(--acc-soft); -webkit-text-stroke: 1px var(--acc); }
.val b { display: block; font: 700 clamp(26px, 2.6vw, 38px)/1.05 var(--font-display); font-stretch: 112%; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
.val p { margin-top: 10px; color: var(--ink-2); }
@media (max-width: 860px) { .vals { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } .val { min-height: 0; gap: 28px; } }
.what { --cols: 5; --mcol: 62%; }
.what div { padding: 20px; border-radius: var(--r-lg); min-height: 150px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; }
.what em { font: 500 12px/1 var(--font-mono); font-style: normal; color: var(--acc-text); }
.what b { font: 700 18px/1.15 var(--font-display); font-stretch: 108%; }
@media (max-width: 1000px) { .what { --cols: 3; } }
/* timeline */
.time { position: relative; }
.time-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(90px, 160px) 30px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 0 clamp(14px, 2vw, 28px); }
.time-row .y { padding: 22px 0; font: 800 clamp(24px, 2.6vw, 38px)/1 var(--font-display); font-stretch: 112%; letter-spacing: -.03em; text-align: right; color: var(--ink-3); transition: color var(--dur-3); }
.time-row .ax { position: relative; }
.time-row .ax::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 1px; margin-left: -.5px; background: var(--stroke-2); }
.time-row .ax::after { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 30px; width: 13px; height: 13px; margin-left: -6.5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--bg); border: 2px solid var(--stroke-3); transition: background-color var(--dur-3), border-color var(--dur-3), box-shadow var(--dur-3); }
.time-row .tx { padding: 22px 0 30px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--stroke); }
.time-row .tx b { display: block; font: 700 20px/1.25 var(--font-display); font-stretch: 106%; }
.time-row .tx p { margin-top: 6px; color: var(--ink-2); max-width: 62ch; }
.time-row.in .y { color: var(--acc-text); }
.time-row.in .ax::after { background: var(--acc); border-color: var(--acc); box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px var(--acc-soft); }
.time-row.up .y { color: var(--ink-3); }
.time-row.up .ax::after { background: var(--bg); border-style: dashed; border-color: var(--acc); box-shadow: none; }
/* ventures */
.ven { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 10px; }
.ven .ltile .lim { width: 88px; height: 88px; background: #fff; }
.ven .ltile .lim.dk { background: #0f2a1a; }
@media (max-width: 1000px) { .ven { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
@media (max-width: 480px) { .ven { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
.aff { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 10px; }
@media (max-width: 760px) { .aff { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
.team { padding: clamp(18px, 2.4vw, 28px); border-radius: var(--r-xl); }
.team .ti { margin-top: 18px; border-radius: 16px; background: #fff; padding: clamp(10px, 2vw, 22px); }
.team .ti img { width: 100%; height: auto; }
.dls { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
.dl { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 20px; border-radius: var(--r-lg); transition: transform var(--dur-3) var(--ease-out); }
.dl:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); }
.dl .di { width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 16px; display: grid; place-items: center; background: var(--acc-soft); color: var(--acc-text); flex: none; }
.dl .di svg { width: 24px; height: 24px; }
.dl b { display: block; font: 700 16px/1.2 var(--font-display); font-stretch: 106%; }
.dl small { display: block; color: var(--ink-3); font-size: 13px; margin-top: 3px; }
@media (max-width: 860px) { .dls { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } }
===HTML===
<section class="phero" data-shape="logo" data-shape-x=".5" data-shape-y=".05" data-shape-s=".85" data-shape-a=".45" data-shape-ma=".2">
  <div class="stage" id="astage">
    <div class="sky"></div><div class="stars"></div>
    <div class="word" aria-hidden="true"><span>SINCE 1967</span></div>
    <div class="glow"></div>
    <div class="ground"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="phero-ui wrap">
    <nav class="crumbs rv" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a><i></i><span>About</span></nav>
    <h1 class="h1 split">Renowned for <span class="accent">its integrity.</span></h1>
    <p class="lead rv d2">S. M. Group began its journey in 1967. Nearly six decades on, S. M. Builders &amp; Developers carries the same promise into every building it raises in Karachi.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" data-shape="plan" data-shape-x="-.6" data-shape-y=".1" data-shape-s=".55" data-shape-a=".3" data-shape-ma=".12">
  <div class="wrap story">
    <div>
      <span class="kicker">Our story</span>
      <h2 class="h2 split" style="font-size:clamp(32px,3.8vw,58px)">Experiential design, novelty <span class="accent">and commitment.</span></h2>
      <p class="big rv d1" style="margin-top:28px">The philosophy of S. M. Group of Companies is based on experiential design, novelty and commitment, in accordance with the basic principles of Islamic values. We started our journey in 1967 with a vision to delight our customers by exceeding their expectations, holding to the highest standards of quality, health, safety and environment while identifying what modern living needs in feasibility, security and innovation.</p>
      <p class="big rv d2">Our team is made up of businessmen and entrepreneurs who have succeeded across diverse business activities, by the grace of Almighty, while keeping to the highest standards of quality, transparency and excellence. That is how we earned our customers' trust and a reputation for being reliable.</p>
      <p class="big rv d3">We have vast experience in property and real estate, primarily in the construction of residential complexes, banquet halls and educational institutions.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="story-img glass rv d1"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec tight" data-shape="globe" data-shape-s=".9" data-shape-a=".3" data-shape-ma=".12" data-shape-spin=".06">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="vis gframe rv">
      <span class="kicker" style="color:oklch(84% .1 84);position:relative;z-index:1">Our vision</span>
