    <div class="sec-head"><div><span class="kicker">Our core values</span><h2 class="h2 split">Driven by <span class="accent">three words.</span></h2></div><p class="lead rv d1">The values S. M. Builders &amp; Developers names as its own, and the reason the group's tagline is "renowned for its integrity".</p></div>
